A                                              Provenance reconstruction
The 137-failure export renumbered example id and dataset index to 0..136, so it appears disjoint
from the parent run under an index join. We recovered the mapping by matching per-example rank
signatures at the three depths the runs share; all 137 signatures are unique and all 137 match. The
twelve failures present in both full-depth runs agree exactly on every rank column, which is what
licenses pooling them into a single 137-versus-488 comparison. An earlier version of this analysis
used only the twelve failures inside the 500-record run, an avoidable loss of power.

